  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "LayoutSwitcher").
  Every key the native LayoutSwitcher resolves lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the EXACT keys extracted from the web source
  (web/src/features/dashboard/components/LayoutSwitcher.tsx). The web i18next
  `${name} (Copy)` template is expressed natively as `%@` (resolved with
  String(format:)). The remaining keys back the native chrome (the save-as alert
  confirm button, VoiceOver tags, the stale/offline freshness chip, and the
  load/empty/error states the P4 state list requires).
*/

